  "body": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN\">\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"pragma\" content=\"no-cache\">\n<meta http-equiv='expires' content='0'>\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title> ACFUN 大 逃 杀 </title><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"favicon.ico\"><!-- 32×32 -->\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"apple-touch-icon.png\"><!-- 180×180 -->\n<link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"site.webmanifest\">\n\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"gamedata/css/style_1.20240331.css\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"gamedata/css/style_card.20240207.css\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"gamedata/css/style_buttons.20240219.css\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"gamedata/css/style_glowbuttons.20230807.css\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"gamedata/css/dts-mobile.20261027.css?v=20261027-batch\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"gamedata/css/style_bubblebox.20240223.css\"><!-- jScrollPanel Utility Start -->\n<!--<link type=\"text/css\" href=\"include/javascript/jScrollPane/jquery.jscrollpane.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" media=\"all\" />\n<link type=\"text/css\" href=\"include/javascript/jScrollPane/jquery.jscrollpane.lozenge.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" media=\"all\" />\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"include/javascript/jScrollPane/jquery.mousewheel.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"include/javascript/jScrollPane/mwheelIntent.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"include/javascript/jScrollPane/jquery.jscrollpane.js\"></script>-->\n\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"include/javascript/jquery-1.12.4.min.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"sourcecode\">\njQuery.noConflict();\n</script>\n<!-- jScrollPanel Utility End -->\n\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"include/javascript/common.20240301.js?v=20261027-batch\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"include/javascript/game.20240318.js?ux=20261027-batch\"></script><!-- gzip Decode Utility Start -->\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"include/javascript/gzip.util.js\"></script>\n<!-- gzip Decode Utility End -->\n\n<!-- Game Word Data Lib Start --><!-- Game Word Data Lib End -->\n\n<!-- jQuery Load Script Utility -->\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"include/javascript/jquery.cachedScript.js\"></script>\n<!-- jQuery Load Script Utility End -->\n\n</head>\n<BODY >\n<div class=\"title\" > ACFUN 大 逃 杀 </div><div class=\"headerlink\" >\n<a href=\"index.php\">>>首页</a><a href=\"messages.php\">>>站内邮件</a>\n<a href=\"user_profile.php\">>>帐号资料</a><a href=\"game.php\">>>进入游戏</a>\n<a href=\"map.php\">>>战场地图</a>\n<a href=\"news.php\">>>进行状况</a>\n<a href=\"alive.php\">>>当前幸存</a>\n<a href=\"winner.php\">>>历史优胜</a>\n<a href=\"rank.php\">>>玩家排行</a>\n<a href=\"help.php\">>>游戏帮助</a>\n<a href=\"logistics.php\">>>刺激市场</a>\n<a href=\"admin.php\">>>游戏管理</a>\n<a href=\"https://bbs.brdts.online/\" target=\"_blank\">>>官方讨论区</a>\n<a href=\"http://amarillonmc.github.io/\" target=\"_blank\">>>官方网站</a>\n<!--[if lt IE 7]> <div style=' clear: both; height: 59px; padding:0 0 0 15px; position: relative;'> <a href=\"http://windows.microsoft.com/en-US/internet-explorer/products/ie/home?ocid=ie6_countdown_bannercode\"><img src=\"http://storage.ie6countdown.com/assets/100/images/banners/warning_bar_0027_Simplified Chinese.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"42\" width=\"820\" alt=\"You are using an outdated browser. For a faster, safer browsing experience, upgrade for free today.\" /></a></div> <![endif]-->\n\n</div><div id=\"fmsgbox-container\"></div><div id=\"hidden-fmsgbox-container\" style=\"display:none;\"></div><div id=\"hidden-persistent-fmsgbox-container\"></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<table align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center;border:0;padding:0;\">\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"yellow b\">游戏版本：</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><span class=\"evergreen b\">N.E.W. v2.3.8</span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;padding:0 0 0 25px;\"><span class=\"yellow b\">站长留言</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"yellow b\">当前时刻：</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><span class=\"evergreen b\">10月30日 星期五 06:12</span></td>\n<td></td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"width:520px; height:100%; vertical-align:top;text-align:left;\">\n<span class=\"evergreen b\"></span>\t\t\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"yellow b\">系统状况：</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><span class=\"evergreen b\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"yellow b\">游戏情报：</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">\n<span class=\"evergreen b\">\n<span class=\"evergreen2\">第 1 回游戏 自选卡片 <font color=\"grey\">已结束</font></span>\n</span>\n</td>\n<td></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div>下局游戏开始时间  <span id=\"timing\"></span>未定<br></div><div>上局结果：<span id=\"lastwin\">最后幸存</span>，优胜者：<span id=\"lastwinner\">admin</span></div><div style=\"margin:8px 0;padding:8px 10px;background:#2b2632;border:1px solid #735979;border-radius:5px;color:#ecdaf3;line-height:1.7;\">\n当前房间没有正在进行的对局。以下是游戏内保存的历史状态快照，<strong>不能当成上一局最终禁区数或死亡人数</strong>；最终胜负请以结算页面和优胜记录为准。\n</div>\n禁区间隔：30 分钟；每次增加：4 个<br>\n历史禁区快照：3<br><br /><br />欢迎你，<ACCOUNT>！\n<form method=\"post\" name=\"togame\" action=\"game.php\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"mode\" value=\"main\">\n<input type=\"submit\" name=\"enter\" value=\"进入游戏\">\n</form>\n\n<form method=\"post\" name=\"quitgame\" action=\"game.php\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"mode\" value=\"quit\">\n<input type=\"submit\" name=\"quit\" value=\"账号退出\">\n</form></td>\n<td></td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"width:400px; vertical-align:top;text-align:left;\"><span class=\"evergreen b\">房间列表：</span><br>\n<span class=\"grey\" style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;\">下表显示各房间当前状态；房间号可能重复使用，不代表同一局。正在游戏中的房间与等待中的房间操作不同。</span><br>\n<div style=\"height:5px;\">&nbsp;</div><div class=\"gscroll\" style=\"width:520px;max-height:300px;\"> 当前没有任何房间。<input type=\"button\" onClick=\"bubblebox_show('persistent-newroombox');\" value=\"新建一个房间\"><br></div><div style=\"height:5px;\">&nbsp;</div>你不在任何一个房间中。<br>\n请选择一个房间进入，或<input type=\"button\" onClick=\"bubblebox_show('persistent-newroombox');\" value=\"新建一个房间\" /><div id=\"fmsgboxpersistent-newroombox\" style=\"display:none\">\n\n<!--构建半透明外缘-->\n<div class=\"bubblebox_positioner\" style=\"z-index:calc(10 + 3);\">\n<div class=\"bubblebox_positioner_inner\" style=\"z-index:calc(10 + 4); \nmargin-top:-226px; \nmargin-left:-166px;\nmin-width:332px; \nmax-width:332px; \nmin-height:451px;\nmax-height:451px;\">\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--END-->\n\n<!--构建文本框-->\n<!--全屏背景降低+跳出点击区-->\n<div class=\"bubblebox_positioner bubblebox_screen_fader\" style=\"z-index:calc(10 + 3);\"  onclick=\"bubblebox_hide('persistent-newroombox');\">\n<div class=\"bubblebox_screen_fader_inner\" style=\"z-index:calc(10 + 5);\nmargin-top:-221px; \nmargin-left:-161px;\nmin-width:322px;\nmax-width:322px;\nmin-height:441px;\nmax-height:441px;\nfilter:alpha(opacity=95);\nopacity:0.95;\" \nonclick=\"if (event.stopPropagation) event.stopPropagation(); else event.cancelBubble = true; \"\n>\n<div class=\"bubblebox_container\" style=\"z-index:calc(10 + 6);\nmargin-left:8px;\nmargin-top:8px;\nmargin-right:0px;\nmargin-bottom:8px;\nmin-height:441px;\nmax-height:441px;\"\n>\n<div class=\"bubblebox_container_inner gscroll scroll-panepersistent-newroombox\" style=\"max-height:425px;width:310px; \">\n<!--END--><div id=\"loading\"></div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<span style=\"line-height:32px;\">创建新房间：</span>\n    <div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#e0e2e9;text-align:left;margin:4px 8px 10px;\">\n      同一账号最多同时创建 <strong>3</strong> 个未结束的非常驻房间；部分模式另有同类型限制。<br>\n      「SOLO模式」实际为<strong>双人1v1</strong>，需两名玩家入座并准备；进入房间后仍须点击空座位。\n    </div><div><a class=\"b_button bc_black\" onclick=\"\nwindow.location.href='roomcmd.php?command=newroom&para1='+0;\n$('loading').style.display='block'\" style=\"margin:3px;width:85px\">SOLO模式</a>\n</div><div><a class=\"b_button bc_black\" onclick=\"\nwindow.location.href='roomcmd.php?command=newroom&para1='+4;\n$('loading').style.display='block'\" style=\"margin:3px;width:85px\">组队模式</a>\n</div><div><a class=\"b_button bc_black\" onclick=\"\nwindow.location.href='roomcmd.php?command=newroom&para1='+5;\n$('loading').style.display='block'\" style=\"margin:3px;width:85px\"><font class='yellow b'>伐木挑战</font></a>\n</div><div><a class=\"b_button bc_black\" onclick=\"\nwindow.location.href='roomcmd.php?command=newroom&para1='+6;\n$('loading').style.display='block'\" style=\"margin:3px;width:85px\"><font class='green b'>PVE解离模式</font></a>\n</div><div><a class=\"b_button bc_black\" onclick=\"\nwindow.location.href='roomcmd.php?command=newroom&para1='+8;\n$('loading').style.display='block'\" style=\"margin:3px;width:85px\"><font class='cyan b'>荣耀模式</font></a>\n</div><div><a class=\"b_button bc_black\" onclick=\"\nwindow.location.href='roomcmd.php?command=newroom&para1='+9;\n$('loading').style.display='block'\" style=\"margin:3px;width:85px\"><font class='red b'>极速模式</font></a>\n</div><div><a class=\"b_button bc_black\" onclick=\"\nwindow.location.href='roomcmd.php?command=newroom&para1='+11;\n$('loading').style.display='block'\" style=\"margin:3px;width:85px\"><font class='vermilion b'>试炼模式</font></a>\n</div><div><a class=\"b_button bc_black\" onclick=\"\nwindow.location.href='roomcmd.php?command=newroom&para1='+14;\n$('loading').style.display='block'\" style=\"margin:3px;width:85px\"><font class='ltazure b'>30分钟竞技 · 双人</font></a>\n</div></div>                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div><div style=\"height:5px;\">&nbsp;</div><div>\n<span class=\"evergreen\" style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:32px;\">如果你是新玩家，请先体验<a href=\"roomcmd.php?command=newroom&amp;para1=7\" class=\"red b\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"> 教程模式 </a>！\n也可在<a href=\"roomcmd.php?command=newroom&amp;para1=13\" class=\"lightblue b\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"> 蹲站模式 </a>获得别样乐趣！\n</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table><!-- 悬浮提示功能 -->\r\n<div id=\"hoverHintMsg\">\r\n<div id=\"hoverHintMsgInner\" class=\"noselect\">\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<script>\r\nfloating_hint();\r\n</script><div style=\"width:100%;position:relative;\">\r\n<div><hr></div><div style=\"float:left;text-align:left\">\r\n<div>\r\n<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:CC-BY-SA\"><img src=\"img/cc-by-sa.png\" style=\"width:96px;height:32px;\"></a>\r\n</div><div id=\"copyright\">\r\n<span>ACFUN大逃杀、电波大逃杀或常磐大逃杀之源代码遵循 <a class=\"evergreen b\" href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:CC-BY-SA\">知识共享 署名-相同方式共享 3.0协议</a>；<br>\r\n游戏背景、剧情及原创角色设定遵循 <b class=\"evergreen b\">知识共享 署名-非商业性使用-相同方式共享 3.0协议</b>。<br></span>\r\n</div>\r\n</div><div style=\"float:right;text-align:right\">\r\n<div>\r\n<span class=\"b\">感谢所有为这个游戏做出贡献的人！</span><br><br><a class=\"evergreen b\" href=\"donate.php\">>>>ACFUN大逃杀的历史及捐助页面<<<</a></div><div id=\"credits1\">\r\n<a onclick=\"$('credits1').style.display='none';$('credits2').style.display='block';\">>>>点此展开 常磐大逃杀电波版 制作者及鸣谢列表<<<</a>\r\n</div><div id=\"credits2\" class=\"ver\" style=\"display:none\">\r\t<a href=\"https://github.com/winddramon/dts/\">DTS N.E.W. v2.3.8 developed by sillycross, Lein, Yoshiko_G, NazoBlaster, </a><br>\n\t<a>and illustrated by KHIBIKI, noui, 菌菌子, サークル　うどんワンタン, 浅水爆弾, けそ, mtkkk. 部分图像资源由 wdhwg001 提供. </a><br>\n\t<a href=\"http://www.jewel-s.jp/\">部分图像资源采用了JewelSaviorFREE[http://www.jewel-s.jp/]的免费素材 </a><br>\n\t<a>部分图像资源使用了ChatGPT、文心一言生成的素材 </a><br>\n\t<a href=\"http://www.amarilloviridian.com\">Reconsituted from 常磐大逃杀 GE600 by 冴月 麟, Yoshiko_G, sillycross, Lein. </a><br>\n\t<a>生存游戏 - BRA简体版V3.0.2 translated by azazil@loongyou.com </a><br>\n\t<a href=\"http://www.b-r-u.net/\">BRU (Battle Royale Ultimate) V0.22 </a><br>\n\t<a>特别鸣谢：h_7, 苹果姐姐, Martin_Chloride, 清理大师, 邪教徒, Sunset Cloudy </a> \n\t<a>感谢所有为这个游戏做出贡献的人 </a></div>\r\n<br><div style=\"float: right;width:80px;clear:right;\">\r\n<!-- Histats.com  START  (standard)-->\r\n<script type=\"text/javascript\">document.write(unescape(\"%3Cscript src=%27http://s10.histats.com/js15_gif.js%27 type=%27text/javascript%27%3E%3C/script%3E\"));</script>\r\n<a href=\"http://www.histats.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"site hit counter\" >\r\n<script  type=\"text/javascript\" >\r\ntry {Histats.startgif(1,1323746,4,10043,\"\");\r\nHistats.track_hits();} catch(err){};\r\n</script>\r\n</a>\r\n<noscript>\r\n<a href=\"http://www.histats.com\" alt=\"site hit counter\" target=\"_blank\" ><div id=\"histatsC\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"http://s4is.histats.com/stats/i/1323746.gif?1323746&amp;103\"></div></a>\r\n</noscript>\r\n<!-- Histats.com  END  -->\r\n</div>\r\n</div><div id=\"error\" style=\"float:left;text-align:left;clear:left;\">\r</div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>\r\n<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.1//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml11/DTD/xhtml11.dtd\">\r\n<html>\r\n <head>\r\n<script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\nvar gaJsHost = ((\"https:\" == document.location.protocol) ? \"https://ssl.\" : \"http://www.\");\r\ndocument.write(unescape(\"%3Cscript src='\" + gaJsHost + \"google-analytics.com/ga.js' type='text/javascript'%3E%3C/script%3E\"));\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\ntry {\r\nvar pageTracker = _gat._getTracker(\"UA-9744745-2\");\r\npageTracker._trackPageview();\r\n} catch(err) {}</script>\r\n </head>\r\n</html>"
